"""KRIES Computer Teacher · C Programming – third set for P2-KRC-06…10 (Pointers, Structures and Unions, Bitwise Operators,
C Preprocessor, Files): 5 × 30 previous-year-pattern 'predict the output' and short-program questions (owner, 13 Oct 2026: 'more and more
questions'). Sizes assume 4-byte int and float, 8-byte double and pointers (64-bit), natural alignment, a little-endian machine where stated,
and ASCII. Every output was traced by hand; undefined or unspecified results are named as such."""
from p2u7_a import PYQ

P = PYQ

